{"sha": "f793a90f3cf744cbb515cdcf0db9cec4eed5dc5197033cf4b1676ca7bf94926f", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:sums} 章 --- 随机变量之和与大数定律}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sums:1}", "每个骰子的期望为", "$\\frac{1 + 2 + \\dots + 6}{6} = \\frac{7}{2}$，由线性性", "可得 $\\E(S) = \\frac72 + \\frac72 = 7$。骰子相互独立，于是", "$\\V(S) = \\frac{35}{12} + \\frac{35}{12} = \\frac{35}{6} \\approx 5.83$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sums:2}", "$\\E(X) = 50$ 且 $\\V(X) = 100 \\times 0.25 = 25$。", "", "马尔可夫不等式（$X \\geq 0$）：$\\P(X \\geq 75) \\leq \\frac{50}{75} = \\frac23$。", "", "比内梅--切比雪夫不等式：", "$\\P(\\abs{X - 50} \\geq 25) \\leq \\frac{25}{25^2} = 0.04$ --- 这一估计甚至", "控制的是\\emph{双侧}事件，其中 $X \\geq 75$ 仅占一半。切比雪夫", "在此精确得多，因为它利用了方差，而不只是均值。", "（$\\P(X \\geq 75)$ 的真实值小于 $10^{-6}$：两个界都", "很粗糙。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sums:3}", "$F_n$ 是 $n$ 个伯努利 $\\left(\\frac12\\right)$ 变量的样本均值，", "其方差为 $\\sigma^2 = \\frac14$。下式", "\\[", "\\P\\left(\\abs{F_n - 0.5} \\geq 0.05\\right)", "\\leq \\frac{1/4}{n \\times 0.05^2} = \\frac{100}{n}", "\\]", "该式 $\\leq 0.05$ 只需 $n \\geq 2000$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sums:4}", "由\\cref{prop:g12:sums:mean}可知，$\\E(M_n) = 5\\%$（分散化并不", "改变期望收益），且", "$\\sigma(M_n) = \\frac{20\\%}{\\sqrt n}$。要求", "$\\frac{20}{\\sqrt n} < 4$ 得 $\\sqrt n > 5$，\\emph{即} $n \\geq 26$。", "这就是\\emph{分散化}原理：将资金分散到", "相互独立的风险上，使风险（标准差）除以 $\\sqrt n$，", "而不降低期望收益。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sums:5}", "\\emph{1.} 数出 $9$ 个等可能的数对：$S$ 取值", "$2, 3, 4, 5, 6$ 的概率分别为", "$\\frac19, \\frac29, \\frac39, \\frac29, \\frac19$。于是", "$\\E(S) = \\frac{2 + 6 + 12 + 10 + 6}{9} = 4$，且", "$\\E(S^2) = \\frac{4 + 18 + 48 + 50 + 36}{9} = \\frac{156}{9} = \\frac{52}{3}$，", "从而 $\\V(S) = \\frac{52}{3} - 16 = \\frac43$。", "", "\\emph{2.} 考虑一个变量：$\\E(X) = 2$，", "$\\E(X^2) = \\frac{1 + 4 + 9}{3} = \\frac{14}{3}$,", "$\\V(X) = \\frac{14}{3} - 4 = \\frac23$。于是 $\\E(S) = 2 + 2 = 4$，再由", "独立性，$\\V(S) = \\frac23 + \\frac23 = \\frac43$。两者的值相同。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sums:6}", "取 $Y = X$，则 $\\V(X + Y) = \\V(2X) = 4\\V(X)$，而", "$\\V(X) + \\V(Y) = 2\\V(X)$。二者仅当 $\\V(X) = 0$ 时相等，\\emph{即}", "当 $X$ 为常数时 --- 因此可加性确实需要独立性", "（此处 $X$ 与其自身完全相依）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sums:7}", "在公平假设下，$F_n$ 是 $n = 1200$ 个伯努利变量的均值，其中", "$p = \\frac16$，$\\sigma^2 = \\frac16\\cdot\\frac56 = \\frac{5}{36}$：", "\\[", "\\P\\left(\\abs{F_n - \\tfrac16} \\geq 0.05\\right)", "\\leq \\frac{5/36}{1200 \\times 0.0025} = \\frac{5}{108} \\approx 0.046 .", "\\]", "观测偏差恰为 $0.05$：这一事件由公平骰子产生", "的概率至多为 $4.6\\%$ --- 由于切比雪夫不等式十分保守，", "真实概率远小于此。公平性假设", "并不可信，这颗骰子很可能是有偏的。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sums:8}", "\\emph{1.} $p(1-p) = \\frac14 - \\left(p - \\frac12\\right)^2 \\leq \\frac14$。", "", "\\emph{2.} $F_n$ 的期望为 $p$，方差为", "$\\frac{p(1-p)}{n} \\leq \\frac{1}{4n}$；由比内梅--切比雪夫不等式得", "\\[", "\\P\\bigl(\\abs{F_n - p} \\geq \\varepsilon\\bigr)", "\\leq \\frac{p(1-p)}{n\\varepsilon^2} \\leq \\frac{1}{4n\\varepsilon^2},", "\\]", "对任意未知的 $p$ 均成立。", "", "\\emph{3.} 取 $\\varepsilon = 0.03$，误差水平为 $0.05$：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{4n(0.03)^2} \\leq 0.05", "\\iff n \\geq \\frac{1}{4 \\times 0.0009 \\times 0.05} \\approx 5556 .", "\\]", "按此粗略界，约 $5600$ 人即足够（经典的", "正态近似结果更接近 $1100$，见", "\\cref{ch:g12:contdist}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:sums:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $V(X + Y) = V(X) + V(Y) = \\frac{35}{12} +", "\\frac{35}{12} = \\frac{35}{6}$（由独立性）。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\E(\\bar X) = 3.5$;", "$\\sigma(\\bar X) = \\frac{1.71}{\\sqrt{100}} \\approx 0.17$：百颗骰子的", "平均值紧贴 $3.5$，偏差在五分之一分以内。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\P(X \\geq 10) \\leq \\frac{2}{10} = 0.2$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} $\\P \\leq \\frac{V(\\bar X)}{0.5^2} =", "\\frac{35/1200}{0.25} \\approx 0.117$：至多约", "$12\\,\\%$。", ""]}